  ('abstinence', 1, 'sexual abstinence', 'Many health professionals advocate for sexual abstinence among teenagers to prevent STDs and unwanted pregnancies.', '许多卫生专业人士提倡青少年进行性禁欲，以防止性传播疾病和意外怀孕。', 'health'),
  ('abstinence', 2, 'abstinence from alcohol', 'After struggling with addiction, he committed to a life of abstinence from alcohol and drugs.', '在与上瘾斗争之后，他决定过上远离酒精和毒品的生活。', 'daily_life'),
