  ('accelerated', 3, 'accelerated pace', 'The accelerated pace of technological advancement is reshaping industries around the world.', '技术进步的加速步伐正在重塑全球各个行业。', 'science_tech'),
  ('rendering', 1, 'rendering of artistic work', 'Critics praised the rendering of artistic work in the exhibition, highlighting its creativity.', '评论家称赞展览中艺术作品的表现，强调其创造性。', 'culture'),
  ('rendering', 2, 'rendering of services', 'The company focuses on the rendering of services that enhance customer satisfaction and loyalty.', '公司专注于提供能提升客户满意度和忠诚度的服务。', 'work'),
  ('rendering', 3, 'rendering process', 'Understanding the rendering process is crucial for improving graphic design and animation quality.', '理解渲染过程对提升图形设计和动画质量至关重要。', 'science_tech'),
  ('fanatic', 1, 'sports fanatic', 'Many sports fanatics will travel thousands of miles to see their favorite teams play.', '许多狂热的体育迷愿意为观看自己喜欢的球队比赛而旅行数千英里。', 'daily_life'),
  ('fanatic', 2, 'religious fanatic', 'Religious fanatics often impose their beliefs on others with little tolerance for dissent.', '宗教狂热者常常对其他人施加他们的信仰，几乎不容忍异议。', 'culture'),
  ('fanatic', 3, 'fanatic supporters', 'The rally attracted a large crowd of fanatic supporters who passionately cheered for their candidate.', '集会吸引了大量狂热的支持者，他们热情地为自己的候选人加油。', 'news'),
  ('nonfiction', 1, 'nonfiction books', 'Many students prefer nonfiction books for their research projects because they provide factual information.', '许多学生在研究项目中更喜欢非虚构类作品，因为它们提供了事实信息。', 'academic'),
  ('nonfiction', 2, 'nonfiction writing', 'He excels in nonfiction writing, capturing the essence of true stories in a compelling way.', '他擅长非虚构类写作，以引人入胜的方式捕捉真实故事的本质。', 'work'),
  ('nonfiction', 3, 'nonfiction genres', 'Exploring the various nonfiction genres can broaden one’s understanding of the world around them.', '探索各种非虚构类体裁可以拓宽一个人对周围世界的理解。', 'culture'),
