  ('jolt', 3, 'jolt of realization', 'During the lecture, a jolt of realization hit me about the importance of the topic.', '在讲座中，我突然意识到这个主题的重要性。', 'education'),
  ('demolition', 1, 'demolition project', 'Many workers were involved in the demolition project, ensuring safety regulations were followed throughout.', '许多工人参与了这个拆除项目，确保在整个过程中遵守安全规定。', 'work'),
  ('demolition', 2, 'demolition permit', 'To begin the renovations, the owner must obtain a demolition permit from the city council.', '为了开始装修，业主必须从市议会获得拆除许可证。', 'daily_life'),
  ('demolition', 3, 'demolition work', 'Local news reported that the demolition work would start next month and last for several weeks.', '当地新闻报道，拆除工作将于下个月开始，持续几周。', 'news'),
  ('proprietor', 1, 'business proprietor', 'Many small businesses struggle under the pressure of rising costs, leaving proprietors anxious about their future.', '许多小企业在不断攀升的成本压力下苦苦挣扎，业主们对未来感到焦虑。', 'work'),
  ('proprietor', 2, 'property proprietor', 'As a property proprietor, she is responsible for maintaining the building and ensuring tenant satisfaction.', '作为一名物业业主，她负责维护大楼并确保租户满意。', 'daily_life'),
  ('proprietor', 3, 'restaurant proprietor', 'The restaurant proprietor decided to introduce a new menu to attract more diners and increase sales.', '这位餐厅业主决定推出新菜单，以吸引更多食客并增加销售额。', 'culture'),
  ('narration', 1, 'narration style', 'Different cultures often have unique styles of narration that reflect their history.', '不同文化常常有着独特的叙述风格，反映其历史。', 'culture'),
  ('narration', 2, 'narration techniques', 'Many educators emphasize the use of narration techniques to enhance student engagement during lessons.', '许多教育工作者强调使用叙述技巧，以提高学生在课堂上的参与度。', 'education'),
