  ('noted', 1, 'noted author', 'Many literary critics have praised the works of the noted author in recent years.', '许多文学评论家近年来赞扬了这位著名作者的作品。', 'culture'),
  ('noted', 2, 'noted researcher', 'The noted researcher delivered an insightful presentation at the international conference yesterday.', '这位著名研究者昨天在国际会议上做了一个深刻的演讲。', 'science_tech'),
  ('noted', 3, 'noted figure', 'A noted figure in educational reform, she has influenced policies nationwide through her work.', '作为教育改革的著名人物，她通过她的工作影响了全国的政策。', 'education'),
