  ('encyclopedia', 2, 'encyclopedia entries', 'Teachers often encourage students to create encyclopedia entries for class projects.', '老师通常鼓励学生为课堂项目创建百科全书条目。', 'education'),
  ('encyclopedia', 3, 'online encyclopedia', 'People frequently consult an online encyclopedia to find quick information on various topics.', '人们经常查阅在线百科全书，以便快速获取各种主题的信息。', 'daily_life'),
  ('delta', 1, 'delta region', 'Geographers study the unique ecosystems found in delta regions around the world.', '地理学家研究世界各地三角洲地区独特的生态系统。', 'environment'),
